Output docs/assets/demo/threads.gif

Hide
Type "./bin/sltty -demo"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show

# Open a conversation, then a thread, and reply.
Ctrl+K
Type "random"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "gg"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "i"
Type "Both, please."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Escape
Sleep 500ms
Type "u"
Sleep 1s
